{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1754391991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1754391991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1754391991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET SUMMER TRISH!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This playful devil-girl lives for beachside fun! She's not a big fan of swimming, but she loves... fruit popsicles. Watching her lick that icy treat is a pure pleasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Life with Trish is anything but boring. She won't leave you alone for a second, always dragging you from one wild adventure to the next. She'll drive you crazy, whirl you into a frenzy, throw a beach orgy until you drop... and she'll make you try every position on that beach mat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1754391991\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Summer Trish as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1754391991\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873680?t=1754391991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873680?t=1754391991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/0f66a835283dba592782498acde47b4268ba46d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754391991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/0f66a835283dba592782498acde47b4268ba46d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754391991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old.\r\nThis DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1754391991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1754391991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873680/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.